\f2\b\fs40 \cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Key Highlights of the Exhibition\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Power of Collaboration
\f0\b0 : The show dismantles the myth of the solitary genius. It highlights how Pablo Picasso, Joan Mir\'f3, and Salvador Dal\'ed worked intimately alongside famous poets, printmakers, and publishers to blend literature and visual art seamlessly. [{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mfa.org/exhibition/picasso-miro-dali-unbound"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 1}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bonart.cat/en/n/47016/picasso-miro-and-dali-reinvent-the-book-as-a-work-of-art-at-the-mfa-in-boston"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 2}}]\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Radical Formats
\f0\b0 : These extravagant, often physically "unbound" objects play with traditional margins, presenting words and abstract designs in intricate ways that defy basic reading expectations. [{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mfa.org/exhibition/picasso-miro-dali-unbound"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 1}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.timeout.com/boston/things-to-do/picasso-miro-dali-unbound"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 2}}]\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Major Pieces on Display
\f0\b0 : Featured works include Dal\'ed's surrealist, dreamlike 1974 illustrations for Sigmund Freud's 
\f4\i Moses and Monotheism
\f0\i0 , alongside collaborative projects by Juan Gris and French poet Pierre Reverdy. [{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mfa.org/exhibition/picasso-miro-dali-unbound"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 1}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.timeout.com/boston/things-to-do/picasso-miro-dali-unbound"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 2}}]\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Rare Archive Material
\f0\b0 : Because these delicate works are rarely shown publicly due to preservation needs, the exhibition gives visitors a unique chance to view masterpieces that are normally locked away in the archives. [{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.timeout.com/boston/things-to-do/picasso-miro-dali-unbound"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 1}}]\
